Honeysuckle Police Station
- Rob evidence room (requires gun) | [if {catalytic_sold_police} == false] [else="hide"]
	if {Inventory.has_item("Gun")} == true:
		You rob the police station. Things go pretty okay
		You find a catalytic converter and pocket a cool vintage looking gun
		do Inventory.add_item("Vintage_Gun")
		do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
		set {catalytic_sold_police} = true
		do Global.use_action()
	else:
		You have nothing to rob with! You fool!
- Bribe police for a vintage gun - $100 | [if {catalytic_sold_police} == false] [else="hide"]
	if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
		The policeman appreicates the tip. He decides to give you a catalytic converter as a bonus
		do Inventory.add_item("Vintage_Gun")
		do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
		set {Global.player_money} -= 100
		set {catalytic_sold_police} = true
		do Global.use_action()
	else:
		The policeman laughs at your pitiful attempt to bribe him.
- Ask for shelter
	To meet quota you are thrown into the slammer
	You lose 20 money
	do Global.change_resolve(20)
	set {Global.player_money} -= 20
	do Global.sleep()
- Leave